category: Libs
build-depends: cygport check
sdesc: "Fast string matching trie library (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "This is the Fast String Matcher Trie project. This C-based library
provides a simple API for the storage and fast matching of ASCII, Extended
ASCII, and 32-bit wide token strings."
